    ],
    "text": "NOTICE UNDER SECTION 29 OF THE LAND REFORM LAW No. 1 OF 1972 AS AMENDED BY LANDREFORM (SPECIAL PROVISIONS) ACT, No. 39 OF 1981 AND LAND REFORM (SPECIAL PROVISIONS)ACT, No. 14 OF 1986",
