  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      374.29,
      539.94,
      421.36
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under the Section 29 of the Law, I hereby, direct every person who is interested in anyagricutlural land or lands described in the Schedule hereto immediately before the date on which such land or lands havebeen vested in the Land Reform Commission to make, within one month from 20.09.2018 a written claim in triplicate to thewhole or any part of the compensation payable under the Law in respect of such land or lands and to specify in the claim.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      83.85,
      434.29,
      332.28,
      481.36
    ],
    "text": "a)His name and addressb)Nature of his interest in such land/landsc)Particulars of his claim andd)How much of such compensation is claimed by him",
